Value Filldown PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value Filldown NETWORK (\S+)
Value DISTANCE (\d+)
Value METRIC (\d+)
Value NEXTHOP_IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value NEXTHOP_IF (\S+)

Start
  ^Codes:.*$$ ->
  ^Gateway.*$$ ->
  ^\s+\S+\s+subnetted.*$$ ->
  ^\s+[A-Z].*$$ ->
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+is directly connected,\s+${NEXTHOP_IF}$$ -> Record
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+\[${DISTANCE}/${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXTHOP_IP}\s*,\s+\S+,\s+${NEXTHOP_IF}$$ -> Record
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+\[${DISTANCE}/${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXTHOP_IP}$$ -> Record
  ^\s+\[${DISTANCE}/${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXTHOP_IP}\s*,\s+\S+,\s+${NEXTHOP_IF}$$ -> Record
